{"unit_id":"shorekeeper-blackshore__dsh-think-command#card-zh","repo":"shorekeeper-blackshore/dsh-think-command","commit":"73cb49a353d980e229f3c158572bd408afc11c75","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-think-command-v3 是 DSH 的会话推理等级命令插件，可在聊天中查看并调整当前模型的 thinking 档位。它向通用 commands 适配器注册 /think，并为 QQ 机器人接入同一处理逻辑。用户可以查看当前模型开放的等级、用英文档位或中文概念词切换、在模型档位不一致时选择最接近的一档，或恢复模型默认值；QQ 列表还提供可点击的档位输入条。适合想按会话控制推理深度的 Web、CLI 与 QQ 用户。无需额外 API Key；QQ 桥接需要 profile 已安装 QQBot 与 dsh-qqbot。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/impl.js:462-495","lib/impl.js:554-592","lib/impl.js:1071-1092"]}
{"unit_id":"shorekeeper-blackshore__dsh-think-command#card-en","repo":"shorekeeper-blackshore/dsh-think-command","commit":"73cb49a353d980e229f3c158572bd408afc11c75","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-think-command-v3 adds /think to view or change reasoning levels in a DSH session. It lists options, maps Chinese or English aliases, validates changes for the next turn, and restores the default. QQ replies offer tap-to-fill chips. No API key is needed; QQ needs bot packages in the profile.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/impl.js:462-495","lib/impl.js:554-592","lib/impl.js:1071-1092"]}
